# Cloudflare Realtime TURN (MK-75, ADR 0008): read by the Vercel Function `api/turn.ts`, never by the
# app bundle (no VITE_ prefix). Secret: set only in Vercel → Production env vars (sensitive), never
# here. Without them `/api/turn` answers 503 and online races use public STUN (previews, local dev).
# CLOUDFLARE_TURN_KEY_ID=
# CLOUDFLARE_TURN_API_TOKEN=
